ICU and critical care settings made use of SHAP and counterfactual methods for mortality prediction and sepsis monitoring, emphasizing the need for actionable and timely explanations. Endocrinology, dermatology, psychiatry, and pathology each had a modest presence, often using hybrid or ensemble XAI pipelines [48,120,121]. Table 6 highlights which clinical areas most frequently adopted XAI in AI systems, with radiology and oncology leading in application. It provides insight into the diversity and impact of XAI across healthcare domains.
